# Switching in a wild battle on Route 202. Piplup L8 (at 1 HP)
# leads, Starly L6 waits. The player switches to Starly (the switch takes the turn: the foe attacks
# Starly), back to Piplup, then fights; if Piplup faints, "Use next Pokémon?" sends Starly in again
# (`battle auto` answers it with the first Pokémon that can go in). Save round trip after the battle.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 8
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_STARLY 6
set state party[0].hp 1
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
+0 battle switch 2
until battle 3000
+0 screenshot switch-starly
+0 battle switch 1
until battle 3000
battle auto 9000
+0 assert battle wild * won
+0 assert battles wild 1
+0 assert state party.length 2
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP"
+0 assert state party[1].species "platinum:SPECIES_STARLY"
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
